          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "фара (fára) was borrowed from French phare 'a lighthouse; a headlight' (EtymDB). Phare goes back to Latin pharus 'a lighthouse', from Greek pháros (EtymDB)."
            }
